        <mxCell id="wtaHdnZoe9IytWEoRQxT-1" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Basic Architecture&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;The backend will handle verification and coomunication with thr network (whatever it may be). The backend makes sure all data passed to the frontend is verified.&lt;br&gt;The frontend is the one that initiates any contact with the backend, weather it is a new update or querying other updates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
